 "title": "Shape Family",
 "body": "<p><strong>Goal:</strong> build a family of shape classes. They all inherit from <code>Shape</code>, but each one overrides <code>draw()</code> to make its own picture.</p>\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li>Open <code>starter.py</code> in Thonny. Read <code>Shape</code> and <code>Square</code> first.</li>\n<li>Finish the <code>TODO</code>s:\n<ul>\n<li><code>Triangle.draw</code> - 3 sides, <code>left(120)</code>.</li>\n<li><code>Star.draw</code> - 5 sides, <code>right(144)</code>.</li>\n<li><code>Polygon.__init__</code> - call <code>super().__init__(x, y, size, color)</code>.</li>\n</ul></li>\n<li>Press <strong>Run</strong>. You should see a 4 x 3 grid of squares, triangles, stars and hexagons in 7 colors (each kind also has its own shape, so you can tell them apart without color).</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Extra:</strong> add a <code>Flower(Shape)</code> class whose <code>draw</code> repeats a small circle 6 times while turning 60 degrees. Add it to <code>make_pattern</code>.</p>\n",
 "hints": [
  {
   "label": "Hint 1",
   "title": "Where to look",
   "html": "<p>Read <code>Square</code> first. It is a finished example. <code>Triangle</code> and <code>Star</code> look almost the same, but with different sides and turns. Then look at <code>Polygon.__init__</code>. It saves <code>sides</code> but forgets something.</p>\n"
  },
  {
   "label": "Hint 2",
   "title": "Try this",
   "html": "<p>Copy the pattern from <code>Square.draw</code>: call <code>self.start(t)</code>, fill, and repeat. Use <code>range(...)</code> for the number of sides. For <code>Polygon</code>, call <code>super().__init__(...)</code> so the parent saves <code>x</code>, <code>y</code>, <code>size</code> and <code>color</code>. Turtle uses <code>left</code> and <code>right</code> to turn.</p>\n"
  },
  {
   "label": "Hint 3",
   "title": "Almost there",
   "html": "<p>A shape draws like this: <code>self.start(t)</code>, <code>t.begin_fill()</code>, <code>for _ in range(____):</code>, then <code>t.forward(self.size)</code> and <code>t.left(____)</code> or <code>t.right(____)</code>, then <code>t.end_fill()</code>. Use the sides and turn from the README. In <code>Polygon</code>, write <code>super().__init__(____, ____, ____, ____)</code>.</p>\n"
  }
 ],
 "starter": {
  "name": "starter.py",
  "raw": "# Shape Family - YOUR version\n# Every shape IS A Shape: it shares x, y, size, color and the start() method.\n# Each child overrides draw() - so the same call, shape.draw(t), makes a\n# different picture for every class (polymorphism).\n# Finish the TODOs, then press Run and see if it does what the README says.\n\nimport turtle\n\nPALETTE = [\"#E69F00\", \"#56B4E9\", \"#009E73\", \"#F0E442\",\n           \"#0072B2\", \"#D55E00\", \"#CC79A7\"]\n\n\nclass Shape:\n    \"\"\"Parent class. A plain Shape is drawn as a dot.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, x, y, size, color):\n        self.x = x\n        self.y = y\n        self.size = size\n        self.color = color\n\n    def start(self, t):\n        \"\"\"Move the turtle to this shape's corner, ready to draw.\"\"\"\n        t.penup()\n        t.goto(self.x, self.y)\n        t.setheading(0)\n        t.pendown()\n        t.color(\"black\", self.color)\n\n    def draw(self, t):\n        self.start(t)\n        t.dot(self.size, self.color)\n\n\nclass Square(Shape):\n    \"\"\"(Already done - use it as an example!)\"\"\"\n\n    def draw(self, t):\n        self.start(t)\n        t.begin_fill()\n        for _ in range(4):\n            t.forward(self.size)\n            t.left(90)\n        t.end_fill()\n\n\nclass Triangle(Shape):\n    # TODO 1: override draw(self, t): like Square, but 3 sides and left(120)\n    pass\n\n\nclass Star(Shape):\n    # TODO 2: override draw(self, t): 5 sides of self.size, turning right(144)\n    pass\n\n\nclass Polygon(Shape):\n    \"\"\"A shape with any number of sides. It needs one extra attribute.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, x, y, size, color, sides):\n        # TODO 3: call super().__init__(x, y, size, color) first\n        self.sides = sides\n\n    def draw(self, t):\n        self.start(t)\n        t.begin_fill()\n        for _ in range(self.sides):\n            t.forward(self.size)\n            t.left(360 / self.sides)\n        t.end_fill()\n\n\ndef draw_all(shapes, t):\n    \"\"\"Draw every shape. We do not need to know which class each one is!\"\"\"\n    for shape in shapes:\n        shape.draw(t)\n\n\ndef make_pattern():\n    \"\"\"Build a 4 x 3 grid of shapes, cycling through classes and colors.\"\"\"\n    shapes = []\n    index = 0\n    for row in range(3):\n        for col in range(4):\n            x = -300 + col * 160\n            y = 120 - row * 150\n            color = PALETTE[index % len(PALETTE)]\n            kind = index % 4\n            if kind == 0:\n                shapes.append(Square(x, y, 70, color))\n            elif kind == 1:\n                shapes.append(Triangle(x, y, 80, color))\n            elif kind == 2:\n                shapes.append(Star(x, y + 50, 90, color))\n            else:\n                shapes.append(Polygon(x, y, 40, color, 6))\n            index = index + 1\n    return shapes\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    screen = turtle.Screen()\n    screen.title(\"Shape Family\")\n    screen.tracer(0)\n    pen = turtle.Turtle()\n    pen.hideturtle()\n    pen.pensize(2)\n    draw_all(make_pattern(), pen)\n    screen.update()\n    turtle.done()\n",
  "html": "<span class=\"tok-c1\"># Shape Family - YOUR version</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c1\"># Every shape IS A Shape: it shares x, y, size, color and the start() method.</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c1\"># Each child overrides draw() - so the same call, shape.draw(t), makes a</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c1\"># different picture for every class (polymorphism).</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c1\"># Finish the TODOs, then press Run and see if it does what the README says.</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-kn\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-nn\">turtle</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-n\">PALETTE</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-p\">[</span><span class=\"tok-s2\">&quot;#E69F00&quot;</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-s2\">&quot;#56B4E9&quot;</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-s2\">&quot;#009E73&quot;</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-s2\">&quot;#F0E442&quot;</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span>\n           <span class=\"tok-s2\">&quot;#0072B2&quot;</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-s2\">&quot;#D55E00&quot;</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-s2\">&quot;#CC79A7&quot;</span><span class=\"tok-p\">]</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">class</span> <span class=\"tok-nc\">Shape</span><span class=\"tok-p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"tok-w\">    </span><span class=\"tok-sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Parent class. A plain Shape is drawn as a dot.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-fm\">__init__</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">x</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">y</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">size</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">color</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">x</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">x</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">y</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">y</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">size</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">size</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">color</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">color</span>\n\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-nf\">start</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n<span class=\"tok-w\">        </span><span class=\"tok-sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Move the turtle to this shape&#39;s corner, ready to draw.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">penup</span><span class=\"tok-p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">goto</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">x</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">y</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">setheading</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-mi\">0</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">pendown</span><span class=\"tok-p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">color</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-s2\">&quot;black&quot;</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">color</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-nf\">draw</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">start</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">dot</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">size</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">color</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">class</span> <span class=\"tok-nc\">Square</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">Shape</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n<span class=\"tok-w\">    </span><span class=\"tok-sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;(Already done - use it as an example!)&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-nf\">draw</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">start</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">begin_fill</span><span class=\"tok-p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">_</span> <span class=\"tok-ow\">in</span> <span class=\"tok-nb\">range</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-mi\">4</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">forward</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">size</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">left</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-mi\">90</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">end_fill</span><span class=\"tok-p\">()</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">class</span> <span class=\"tok-nc\">Triangle</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">Shape</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-c1\"># TODO 1: override draw(self, t): like Square, but 3 sides and left(120)</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">pass</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">class</span> <span class=\"tok-nc\">Star</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">Shape</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-c1\"># TODO 2: override draw(self, t): 5 sides of self.size, turning right(144)</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">pass</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">class</span> <span class=\"tok-nc\">Polygon</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">Shape</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n<span class=\"tok-w\">    </span><span class=\"tok-sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;A shape with any number of sides. It needs one extra attribute.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-fm\">__init__</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">x</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">y</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">size</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">color</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">sides</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-c1\"># TODO 3: call super().__init__(x, y, size, color) first</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">sides</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">sides</span>\n\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-nf\">draw</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">start</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">begin_fill</span><span class=\"tok-p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">_</span> <span class=\"tok-ow\">in</span> <span class=\"tok-nb\">range</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">sides</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">forward</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">size</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">left</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-mi\">360</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">/</span> <span class=\"tok-bp\">self</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">sides</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">end_fill</span><span class=\"tok-p\">()</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-nf\">draw_all</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">shapes</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n<span class=\"tok-w\">    </span><span class=\"tok-sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Draw every shape. We do not need to know which class each one is!&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">shape</span> <span class=\"tok-ow\">in</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">shapes</span><span class=\"tok-p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-n\">shape</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">draw</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-nf\">make_pattern</span><span class=\"tok-p\">():</span>\n<span class=\"tok-w\">    </span><span class=\"tok-sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Build a 4 x 3 grid of shapes, cycling through classes and colors.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-n\">shapes</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-p\">[]</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-n\">index</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-mi\">0</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">row</span> <span class=\"tok-ow\">in</span> <span class=\"tok-nb\">range</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-mi\">3</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">col</span> <span class=\"tok-ow\">in</span> <span class=\"tok-nb\">range</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-mi\">4</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-n\">x</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">-</span><span class=\"tok-mi\">300</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">+</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">col</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">*</span> <span class=\"tok-mi\">160</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-n\">y</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-mi\">120</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">-</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">row</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">*</span> <span class=\"tok-mi\">150</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-n\">color</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">PALETTE</span><span class=\"tok-p\">[</span><span class=\"tok-n\">index</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">%</span> <span class=\"tok-nb\">len</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">PALETTE</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)]</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-n\">kind</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">index</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">%</span> <span class=\"tok-mi\">4</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">kind</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">==</span> <span class=\"tok-mi\">0</span><span class=\"tok-p\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"tok-n\">shapes</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">append</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">Square</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">x</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">y</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-mi\">70</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">color</span><span class=\"tok-p\">))</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">elif</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">kind</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">==</span> <span class=\"tok-mi\">1</span><span class=\"tok-p\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"tok-n\">shapes</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">append</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">Triangle</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">x</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">y</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-mi\">80</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">color</span><span class=\"tok-p\">))</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">elif</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">kind</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">==</span> <span class=\"tok-mi\">2</span><span class=\"tok-p\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"tok-n\">shapes</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">append</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">Star</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">x</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">y</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">+</span> <span class=\"tok-mi\">50</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-mi\">90</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">color</span><span class=\"tok-p\">))</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">else</span><span class=\"tok-p\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"tok-n\">shapes</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">append</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">Polygon</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">x</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">y</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-mi\">40</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">color</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-mi\">6</span><span class=\"tok-p\">))</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-n\">index</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">index</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">+</span> <span class=\"tok-mi\">1</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">shapes</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> <span class=\"tok-vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">==</span> <span class=\"tok-s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"tok-p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-n\">screen</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">turtle</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">Screen</span><span class=\